<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Tremorsense</ansi> mutation

Nerve clusters bloom in your feet and palms, reading vibrations
through stone and soil. You feel footsteps, heartbeats, the shift
of weight before a strike — but the constant noise overwhelms your
fine motor control.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Detect hidden creatures through ground vibrations — concealment
  offers little protection against you
  Moderately improved perception from the wealth of sensory data

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly reduced dexterity — the constant vibration noise
  disrupts fine motor control

